            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u5b8c\u6210"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finished in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u5728\u201c%@\u201d\u4e2d\u5b8c\u6210"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First, set up this iPhone. About 5 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b8c\u6210\u6b64 iPhone \u7684\u521d\u59cb\u8bbe\u7f6e\uff0c\u7ea6\u9700 5 \u5206\u949f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fix the item below so your agents can use this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5904\u7406\u4e0b\u65b9\u95ee\u9898\u540e\uff0c\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u5373\u53ef\u4f7f\u7528\u6b64 iPhone\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a code, first turn on device code sign-in for Codex in ChatGPT \u203a Settings \u203a Security. Then enter the code on auth.openai.com/codex/device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f7f\u7528\u9a8c\u8bc1\u7801\u767b\u5f55\u524d\uff0c\u8bf7\u5148\u5728 ChatGPT \u7684\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u5b89\u5168\u201d\u4e2d\u542f\u7528 Codex \u8bbe\u5907\u7801\u767b\u5f55\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u524d\u5f80 auth.openai.com/codex/device \u8f93\u5165\u9a8c\u8bc1\u7801\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free on the App Store": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Store \u514d\u8d39\u63d0\u4f9b"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full Access lets the panel talk to Qeno on this iPhone. It has no network access and never uses the clipboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b8c\u5168\u8bbf\u95ee\u8ba9\u9762\u677f\u80fd\u4e0e\u672c\u673a\u4e0a\u7684 Qeno \u901a\u4fe1\u3002\u5b83\u4e0d\u8054\u7f51\uff0c\u4e5f\u4e0d\u4f7f\u7528\u526a\u8d34\u677f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get LocalDevVPN on the App Store": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728 App Store \u83b7\u53d6 LocalDevVPN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gives Qeno its own key to this iPhone. The key stays on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3a Qeno \u751f\u6210\u8bbf\u95ee\u6b64 iPhone \u7684\u4e13\u5c5e\u5bc6\u94a5\u3002\u5bc6\u94a5\u4ec5\u4fdd\u7559\u5728\u672c\u673a\u4e0a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Settings \u203a Other and turn on Include route 10.7.0.1/32 (update Shadowrocket if missing).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u524d\u5f80\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u5176\u4ed6\u201d\u5e76\u5f00\u542f\u201c\u5305\u542b\u8def\u7531 10.7.0.1/32\u201d\uff08\u82e5\u65e0\u6b64\u9009\u9879\u8bf7\u66f4\u65b0 Shadowrocket\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi, I\u2019m Qeno. Tell me what to do on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u597d\uff0c\u6211\u662f Qeno\u3002\u8bf7\u544a\u8bc9\u6211\u9700\u8981\u5728\u8fd9\u53f0 iPhone \u4e0a\u6267\u884c\u4ec0\u4e48\u64cd\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "History": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5386\u53f2\u8bb0\u5f55"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold and say it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6309\u4f4f\u8bf4\u8bdd\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold to Talk": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6309\u4f4f\u8bf4\u8bdd"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold to add something": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6309\u4f4f\u7ee7\u7eed\u8bf4"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold to talk, slide up to end": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6309\u4f4f\u8bf4\u8bdd\uff0c\u4e0a\u6ed1\u7ed3\u675f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home Screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3b\u5c4f\u5e55"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to Add It": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5982\u4f55\u6dfb\u52a0"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I stopped after %lld steps. Tell me how to go on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u6267\u884c %lld \u6b65\u5e76\u6682\u505c\u3002\u8bf7\u6307\u793a\u4e0b\u4e00\u6b65\u64cd\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IPv6 present: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6709 IPv6\uff1a%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Idle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7a7a\u95f2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import Pairing File": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5bfc\u5165\u914d\u5bf9\u6587\u4ef6"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Qeno's Setup, enable the local connection or choose an external connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728 Qeno \u7684\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5f15\u5bfc\u4e2d\u5f00\u542f\u672c\u673a\u8fde\u63a5\uff0c\u6216\u9009\u62e9\u5916\u90e8\u8fde\u63a5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Use": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f7f\u7528\u4e2d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install **Qeno Runner** (poki-runner-unsigned.ipa) with the same tool and Apple ID you used for Qeno.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f7f\u7528\u4e0e\u5b89\u88c5 Qeno \u76f8\u540c\u7684\u5de5\u5177\u548c Apple ID \u5b89\u88c5 **Qeno Runner** (poki-runner-unsigned.ipa)\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Qeno Module": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b89\u88c5 Qeno \u6a21\u5757"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Qeno Plugin": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b89\u88c5 Qeno \u63d2\u4ef6"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Qeno Runner": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b89\u88c5 Qeno Runner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Qeno Runner (poki-runner-unsigned.ipa) with the same signing tool and Apple ID as Qeno, then trust its developer in Settings \u2192 General \u2192 VPN & Device Management.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7528\u4e0e Qeno \u76f8\u540c\u7684\u7b7e\u540d\u5de5\u5177\u548c Apple ID \u5b89\u88c5 Qeno Runner\uff08poki-runner-unsigned.ipa\uff09\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u901a\u7528 \u203a VPN \u4e0e\u8bbe\u5907\u7ba1\u7406\u201d\u4e2d\u4fe1\u4efb\u5b83\u7684\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u5b89\u88c5"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invalid Pairing File: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u914d\u5bf9\u6587\u4ef6\u65e0\u6548\uff1a%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I\u2019ll ask before anything you can\u2019t undo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6267\u884c\u4e0d\u53ef\u64a4\u9500\u7684\u64cd\u4f5c\u524d\uff0c\u6211\u4f1a\u5148\u5411\u4f60\u786e\u8ba4\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep IPv6 out of the tun address list.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u52ff\u5728 tun \u5730\u5740\u5217\u8868\u4e2d\u5305\u542b IPv6\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Qeno Running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4fdd\u6301 Qeno \u540e\u53f0\u8fd0\u884c"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Shadowrocket connected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4fdd\u6301 Shadowrocket \u5904\u4e8e\u8fde\u63a5\u72b6\u6001\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your existing VPN connected. Qeno uses its loopback and leaves its own VPN off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4fdd\u6301\u73b0\u6709 VPN \u8fde\u63a5\u3002Qeno \u4f7f\u7528\u5b83\u7684\u56de\u73af\uff0c\u4e0d\u5f00\u542f\u81ea\u5df1\u7684 VPN\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your usual keyboards. Then switch to the Qeno keyboard once in any text field, so Qeno knows it is there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4fdd\u7559\u4f60\u5e38\u7528\u7684\u952e\u76d8\u3002\u7136\u540e\u5728\u4efb\u610f\u8f93\u5165\u6846\u4e2d\u5207\u6362\u5230 Qeno \u952e\u76d8\u4e00\u6b21\uff0c\u8ba9 Qeno \u77e5\u9053\u5b83\u5df2\u5c31\u7eea\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps Qeno connected in the background and shows its activity on the Lock Screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9 Qeno \u5728\u540e\u53f0\u4fdd\u6301\u8fde\u63a5\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u9501\u5b9a\u5c4f\u5e55\u4e0a\u663e\u793a\u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Key added": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5bc6\u94a5\u5df2\u6dfb\u52a0"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u952e\u76d8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keys stay in this iPhone\u2019s Keychain. Qeno sends each key only to its own provider.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5bc6\u94a5\u4ec5\u4fdd\u5b58\u5728\u672c\u673a\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\uff0c\u4e14\u4ec5\u53d1\u9001\u7ed9\u5bf9\u5e94\u670d\u52a1\u5546\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LOCAL CONNECTION": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u672c\u673a\u8fde\u63a5"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LOG": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65e5\u5fd7"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last Run": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0a\u6b21\u8fd0\u884c"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last answer %lld ms after you stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0a\u6b21\u54cd\u5e94\u8017\u65f6 %lld \u6beb\u79d2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last step": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0a\u4e00\u6b65"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets the agent do the step that is waiting for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba9\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u6267\u884c\u6b63\u5728\u7b49\u4f60\u6279\u51c6\u7684\u8fd9\u4e00\u6b65\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening\u2026": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b63\u5728\u503e\u542c\u2026"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activities are off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8\u5df2\u5173\u95ed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activities are off for Qeno (Settings > Qeno > Live Activities).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u7684\u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8\u5df2\u5173\u95ed\uff08\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a Qeno \u203a \u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activities are off for Qeno. Turn them on to view agent steps and approve sensitive actions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u7684\u201c\u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8\u201d\u5df2\u5173\u95ed\u3002\u5f00\u542f\u540e\u5373\u53ef\u67e5\u770b\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u64cd\u4f5c\u5e76\u6279\u51c6\u654f\u611f\u64cd\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activities are on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u5f00\u542f\u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activity": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activity Preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8\u9884\u89c8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activity is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8\u5df2\u5173\u95ed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local VPN connected. The check above confirms developer access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u672c\u673a VPN \u5df2\u8fde\u63a5\u3002\u4e0a\u65b9\u7684\u68c0\u67e5\u4f1a\u786e\u8ba4\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u670d\u52a1\u80fd\u5426\u8bbf\u95ee\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f4d\u7f6e"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location Services is off for Qeno, so iOS will suspend it shortly after you leave the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u7684\u5b9a\u4f4d\u670d\u52a1\u5df2\u5173\u95ed\uff0c\u79bb\u5f00 App \u540e iOS \u4f1a\u5f88\u5feb\u5c06\u5176\u6302\u8d77\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location allowed. Qeno stays active in the background and never records your location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u5141\u8bb8\u8bbf\u95ee\u4f4d\u7f6e\u4fe1\u606f\u3002Qeno \u4f1a\u5728\u540e\u53f0\u4fdd\u6301\u8fd0\u884c\uff0c\u4e14\u7edd\u4e0d\u8bb0\u5f55\u4f60\u7684\u4f4d\u7f6e\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65e5\u5fd7"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Logs, checks, background hold, addresses, and Live Activity preview.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65e5\u5fd7\u3001\u8fde\u63a5\u68c0\u67e5\u3001\u540e\u53f0\u4fdd\u6d3b\u3001\u7f51\u7edc\u5730\u5740\u4e0e\u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8\u9884\u89c8\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking for this iPhone at 10.7.0.1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
