          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mounting the developer disk image timed out. Qeno needs the internet once after each restart to get Apple's signature; check Wi-Fi or cellular. Qeno tries again by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u88c5\u8f7d\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u78c1\u76d8\u6620\u50cf\u8d85\u65f6\u3002\u6bcf\u6b21\u91cd\u542f\u540e Qeno \u9700\u8981\u8054\u7f51\u4e00\u6b21\u4ee5\u83b7\u53d6 Apple \u7684\u7b7e\u540d\uff0c\u8bf7\u68c0\u67e5\u65e0\u7ebf\u5c40\u57df\u7f51\u6216\u8702\u7a9d\u7f51\u7edc\u3002Qeno \u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u91cd\u8bd5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mute Qeno's voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9759\u97f3"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u540d\u79f0"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name, e.g., Claude": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u540d\u79f0\uff0c\u4f8b\u5982 Claude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native services": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u539f\u751f\u670d\u52a1"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native services controls the phone through its paired accessibility, screenshot and input services, with no automation session and no banner. The XCTest session is the earlier way, with iOS\u2019s automation banner.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u539f\u751f\u670d\u52a1\u901a\u8fc7\u5df2\u914d\u5bf9\u7684\u8f85\u52a9\u529f\u80fd\u3001\u622a\u5c4f\u548c\u8f93\u5165\u670d\u52a1\u63a7\u5236\u624b\u673a\uff0c\u6ca1\u6709\u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u4f1a\u8bdd\uff0c\u4e5f\u6ca1\u6709\u6a2a\u5e45\u3002XCTest \u4f1a\u8bdd\u662f\u65e9\u671f\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\uff0c\u4f1a\u663e\u793a iOS \u7684\u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u6a2a\u5e45\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native services controls the phone without an XCTest automation session or its banner. Change it under Setup \u203a Advanced \u203a Testing Options.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u539f\u751f\u670d\u52a1\u65e0\u9700 XCTest \u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u4f1a\u8bdd\u53ca\u5176\u6a2a\u5e45\u5373\u53ef\u63a7\u5236\u624b\u673a\u3002\u53ef\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u9ad8\u7ea7 \u203a \u6d4b\u8bd5\u9009\u9879\u201d\u4e2d\u66f4\u6539\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
