            "value": "\u6253\u5f00 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open **Settings \u203a Developer**. It appears once Developer Mode is on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u201c**\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u5f00\u53d1\u8005**\u201d\u3002\u5f00\u542f\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f\u540e\u4f1a\u663e\u793a\u6b64\u9009\u9879\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open **Settings \u203a General \u203a Keyboard \u203a Keyboards \u203a Add New Keyboard** and choose **Qeno**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00**\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u901a\u7528 \u203a \u952e\u76d8 \u203a \u952e\u76d8 \u203a \u6dfb\u52a0\u65b0\u952e\u76d8**\uff0c\u9009\u62e9 **Qeno**\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open **Settings \u203a General \u203a VPN & Device Management**, tap your Apple ID, then tap **Trust**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u201c**\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u901a\u7528 \u203a VPN \u4e0e\u8bbe\u5907\u7ba1\u7406**\u201d\uff0c\u8f7b\u70b9\u4f60\u7684 Apple ID\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c**\u4fe1\u4efb**\u201d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open **Settings \u203a Privacy & Security \u203a Developer Mode**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u201c**\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168 \u203a \u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f**\u201d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open **Settings \u203a Privacy & Security \u203a Developer Mode**. It appears once Qeno Runner is installed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u201c**\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168\u6027 \u203a \u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f**\u201d\u3002\u5b89\u88c5 Qeno Runner \u540e\u4f1a\u663e\u793a\u6b64\u9009\u9879\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Messages": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u201c\u4fe1\u606f\u201d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Qeno and download the developer disk image again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00 Qeno\uff0c\u91cd\u65b0\u4e0b\u8f7d\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u78c1\u76d8\u6620\u50cf\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Qeno and let it download the developer disk image (about 20 MB), once.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00 Qeno\uff0c\u8ba9\u5b83\u4e0b\u8f7d\u4e00\u6b21\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u78c1\u76d8\u6620\u50cf\uff08\u7ea6 20 MB\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u201d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Setup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5f15\u5bfc"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Setup \u203a Loopback and check the loopback, then pair this iPhone again in Setup \u203a Pairing with the loopback on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5f15\u5bfc \u203a \u56de\u73af\u201d\u68c0\u67e5\u56de\u73af\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u5728\u56de\u73af\u5f00\u7740\u65f6\u5230\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5f15\u5bfc \u203a \u914d\u5bf9\u201d\u91cd\u65b0\u914d\u5bf9\u8fd9\u53f0 iPhone\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Shadowrocket.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00 Shadowrocket\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open it and tap Connect, then return to Qeno. It may disconnect another VPN app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u5e76\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c\u8fde\u63a5\u201d\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u56de\u5230 Qeno\u3002\u5b83\u53ef\u80fd\u4f1a\u65ad\u5f00\u5176\u4ed6 VPN App\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open it and tap Connect. It uses the VPN slot and replaces any active VPN while on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u5e76\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c\u8fde\u63a5\u201d\u3002\u5b83\u4f1a\u5360\u7528\u7cfb\u7edf VPN \u901a\u9053\uff0c\u5f00\u542f\u671f\u95f4\u4f1a\u66ff\u6362\u5176\u4ed6 VPN\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the Sign-In Page": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u767b\u5f55\u9875\u9762"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the chat with Mom": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6253\u5f00\u4e0e\u5988\u5988\u7684\u5bf9\u8bdd"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI answered %lld: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenAI \u8fd4\u56de\u9519\u8bef\uff08%lld\uff09\uff1a%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI did not accept the key. Check it in Qeno \u203a Model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenAI \u5bc6\u94a5\u65e0\u6548\u3002\u8bf7\u524d\u5f80\u201cQeno\u201d\u203a\u201c\u6a21\u578b\u201d\u68c0\u67e5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI did not give a sign-in code (%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65e0\u6cd5\u4ece OpenAI \u83b7\u53d6\u767b\u5f55\u7801\uff08%lld\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI did not hand over the sign-in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u672a\u6536\u5230 OpenAI \u7684\u767b\u5f55\u54cd\u5e94\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI has not turned on code sign-in for this account. Use the browser sign-in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b64\u8d26\u53f7\u672a\u542f\u7528\u9a8c\u8bc1\u7801\u767b\u5f55\uff0c\u8bf7\u6539\u7528\u6d4f\u89c8\u5668\u767b\u5f55\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI refused the sign-in code (%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenAI \u62d2\u7edd\u4e86\u6b64\u767b\u5f55\u7801\uff08%lld\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI says the key has hit its rate limit. Try again in a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u6c42\u8fc7\u4e8e\u9891\u7e41\uff0c\u8bf7\u7a0d\u540e\u518d\u8bd5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI's answer to the sign-in code was not readable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65e0\u6cd5\u89e3\u6790 OpenAI \u7684\u767b\u5f55\u7801\u54cd\u5e94\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening tunnel": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b63\u5728\u6253\u5f00\u96a7\u9053"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u53ef\u9009"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. To renew Qeno without a Mac, sign in to your Apple Account here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u53ef\u9009\u3002\u4e0d\u8fde Mac \u4e5f\u60f3\u7eed\u7b7e\u65f6\uff0c\u53ef\u4ee5\u5728\u8fd9\u91cc\u767b\u5f55 Apple \u8d26\u53f7\uff0c\u8ba9 Qeno \u81ea\u5df1\u7eed\u7b7e\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PROXY LOOPBACK INTERFACE": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ee3\u7406\u56de\u73af\u63a5\u53e3"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u91cd\u65b0\u914d\u5bf9"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair This iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u914d\u5bf9\u6b64 iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair again in Qeno's setup.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5728 Qeno \u7684\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5f15\u5bfc\u4e2d\u91cd\u65b0\u914d\u5bf9\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair in Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u201d\u4e2d\u914d\u5bf9"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair this iPhone again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u91cd\u65b0\u914d\u5bf9\u6b64 iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair this iPhone first (Setup).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5148\u914d\u5bf9\u6b64 iPhone\uff08\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5f15\u5bfc\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u914d\u5bf9"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired. Checked the next time the runner starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u914d\u5bf9\u3002Runner \u4e0b\u6b21\u542f\u52a8\u65f6\u4f1a\u518d\u6b21\u68c0\u67e5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired. The phone accepted it at %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u914d\u5bf9\u3002iPhone \u4e8e %@ \u63a5\u53d7\u4e86\u914d\u5bf9\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u914d\u5bf9"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairing Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u914d\u5bf9\u7801"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairing code %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
