            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u914d\u5bf9\u7801 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7c98\u8d34"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6682\u505c"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paused for you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u4e3a\u4f60\u6682\u505c"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port on 10.7.0.1": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10.7.0.1 \u7aef\u53e3"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preparing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b63\u5728\u51c6\u5907"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QR code of the address": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5730\u5740\u4e8c\u7ef4\u7801"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno Is Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5df2\u5173\u95ed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno Keyboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u952e\u76d8"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno Runner did not start. In Settings \u2192 Developer, turn on UI Automation; in Settings \u2192 General \u2192 VPN & Device Management, trust the developer of Qeno Runner.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno Runner \u6ca1\u6709\u542f\u52a8\u3002\u8bf7\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u201d\u4e2d\u5f00\u542f UI \u81ea\u52a8\u5316\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u901a\u7528 \u203a VPN \u4e0e\u8bbe\u5907\u7ba1\u7406\u201d\u4e2d\u4fe1\u4efb Qeno Runner \u7684\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno Runner is installed and trusted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5df2\u5b89\u88c5\u5e76\u4fe1\u4efb Qeno Runner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno Runner is still running after Stop. Swipe it away in the app switcher; the banner goes with it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u505c\u6b62\u540e Qeno Runner \u4ecd\u5728\u8fd0\u884c\u3002\u8bf7\u5728 App \u5207\u6362\u5668\u4e2d\u5c06\u5b83\u5212\u6389\uff0c\u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u6a2a\u5e45\u4f1a\u968f\u4e4b\u6d88\u5931\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno Setup on your Mac renews Qeno when this iPhone is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u53f0 iPhone \u8fde\u4e0a Mac \u65f6\uff0cQeno Setup \u4f1a\u4e3a Qeno \u7eed\u7b7e\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u7248\u672c"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno asks you before an agent pays, deletes, sends a message, places a call, types a password or does anything in Wallet: on the Live Activity, in a notification, or here in Qeno. Turned off, agents do all of that without asking. Changes take effect the next time Qeno opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ee3\u7406\u4ed8\u6b3e\u3001\u5220\u9664\u3001\u53d1\u6d88\u606f\u3001\u6253\u7535\u8bdd\u3001\u8f93\u5165\u5bc6\u7801\u6216\u5728\u94b1\u5305\u91cc\u64cd\u4f5c\u4e4b\u524d\uff0cQeno \u4f1a\u5148\u95ee\u4f60\uff1a\u5728\u5b9e\u65f6\u6d3b\u52a8\u3001\u901a\u77e5\u6216 Qeno \u91cc\u6279\u51c6\u3002\u5173\u6389\u540e\uff0c\u8fd9\u4e9b\u64cd\u4f5c\u90fd\u4e0d\u518d\u8be2\u95ee\u3002\u66f4\u6539\u5728\u4e0b\u6b21\u6253\u5f00 Qeno \u65f6\u751f\u6548\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno can't reach this iPhone. Check in this order: Setup \u203a Loopback (your proxy app or LocalDevVPN is connected, with 10.7.0.1 set), then Setup \u203a Pairing (pair again with the loopback on), then Developer Mode in Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u8fde\u4e0d\u4e0a\u8fd9\u53f0 iPhone\u3002\u8bf7\u6309\u987a\u5e8f\u68c0\u67e5\uff1a\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5f15\u5bfc \u203a \u56de\u73af\u201d\uff08\u4ee3\u7406 App \u6216 LocalDevVPN \u5df2\u8fde\u63a5\uff0c\u5e76\u5df2\u8bbe\u597d 10.7.0.1\uff09\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5f15\u5bfc \u203a \u914d\u5bf9\u201d\uff08\u5728\u56de\u73af\u5f00\u7740\u65f6\u91cd\u65b0\u914d\u5bf9\uff09\uff0c\u6700\u540e\u662f\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168\u6027\u201d\u91cc\u7684\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno can't use the microphone. Allow it in Settings, Privacy, Microphone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u65e0\u6cd5\u8bbf\u95ee\u9ea6\u514b\u98ce\u3002\u8bf7\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u201d\u203a\u201c\u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168\u6027\u201d\u203a\u201c\u9ea6\u514b\u98ce\u201d\u4e2d\u5f00\u542f\u6743\u9650\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno cannot access the keychain and has no relay key yet. Reinstall Qeno with your signing tool, then reopen Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u65e0\u6cd5\u8bbf\u95ee\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\uff0c\u56e0\u6b64\u5c1a\u65e0\u4e2d\u8f6c\u5bc6\u94a5\u3002\u8bf7\u4f7f\u7528\u7b7e\u540d\u5de5\u5177\u91cd\u65b0\u5b89\u88c5 Qeno\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u91cd\u65b0\u6253\u5f00\u8bbe\u7f6e\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno can\u2019t stay on in the background": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u65e0\u6cd5\u5728\u540e\u53f0\u4fdd\u6301\u8fd0\u884c"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno could not reach %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65e0\u6cd5\u8fde\u63a5 %@\uff1a%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno couldn\u2019t read its relay key from the keychain (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u65e0\u6cd5\u4ece\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u8bfb\u53d6\u4e2d\u8f6c\u5bc6\u94a5\uff08%@\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno has no default relay. Deploy your own to your Cloudflare account with deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh from the Qeno repository, then enter the address it prints. Screenshots and taps pass only through that relay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6ca1\u6709\u9ed8\u8ba4\u4e2d\u8f6c\u3002\u8bf7\u7528 Qeno \u4ed3\u5e93\u4e2d\u7684 deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh \u628a\u4e2d\u8f6c\u90e8\u7f72\u5230\u4f60\u81ea\u5df1\u7684 Cloudflare \u8d26\u6237\uff0c\u518d\u8f93\u5165\u5b83\u8f93\u51fa\u7684\u5730\u5740\u3002\u622a\u56fe\u548c\u8f7b\u70b9\u53ea\u7ecf\u8fc7\u8fd9\u4e2a\u4e2d\u8f6c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno is offline. Check that the phone has internet; Qeno reconnects by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5df2\u79bb\u7ebf\u3002\u8bf7\u68c0\u67e5\u6b64 iPhone \u7684\u7f51\u7edc\u8fde\u63a5\uff0cQeno \u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u91cd\u65b0\u8fde\u63a5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno keeps the key now; chatting with %@ comes in an update. Until then, choose Anthropic or OpenAI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5bc6\u94a5\u5df2\u4fdd\u5b58\u3002%@ \u5bf9\u8bdd\u529f\u80fd\u5c06\u5728\u540e\u7eed\u66f4\u65b0\u4e2d\u63a8\u51fa\uff0c\u76ee\u524d\u8bf7\u9009\u62e9 Anthropic \u6216 OpenAI\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno log": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u65e5\u5fd7"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno looks on GitHub for the newest build on the chosen channel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4f1a\u5728 GitHub \u4e0a\u67e5\u627e\u6240\u9009\u901a\u9053\u7684\u6700\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u9700\u8981\u4f60\u5904\u7406"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs the internet once after each restart of the phone to get Apple's signature for the developer disk image. Check Wi-Fi or cellular; Qeno tries again by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u624b\u673a\u6bcf\u6b21\u91cd\u542f\u540e\uff0cQeno \u9700\u8981\u8054\u7f51\u4e00\u6b21\uff0c\u4e3a\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u78c1\u76d8\u6620\u50cf\u83b7\u53d6 Apple \u7684\u7b7e\u540d\u3002\u8bf7\u68c0\u67e5\u65e0\u7ebf\u5c40\u57df\u7f51\u6216\u8702\u7a9d\u7f51\u7edc\uff0cQeno \u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u91cd\u8bd5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs your OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u9700\u8981\u4f60\u6279\u51c6"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno opens the main Settings page. Go to **Privacy & Security \u203a Developer Mode** and tap **Pair with Qeno**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5c06\u6253\u5f00\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u201d\u9996\u9875\u3002\u524d\u5f80\u201c**\u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168 \u203a \u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f**\u201d\u5e76\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c**Pair with Qeno\uff08\u4e0e Qeno \u914d\u5bf9\uff09**\u201d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno shows steps, pairing codes, and approvals on the Lock Screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4f1a\u5728\u9501\u5b9a\u5c4f\u5e55\u4e0a\u663e\u793a\u64cd\u4f5c\u6b65\u9aa4\u3001\u914d\u5bf9\u7801\u548c\u6279\u51c6\u8bf7\u6c42\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno starts it again on the next agent request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u4e0b\u6b21\u53d1\u51fa\u8bf7\u6c42\u65f6\uff0cQeno \u4f1a\u91cd\u65b0\u542f\u52a8\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno stops opening after %@. Connect this iPhone to your Mac and ask your agent to renew it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ \u4e4b\u540e Qeno \u5c06\u65e0\u6cd5\u6253\u5f00\u3002\u8bf7\u628a\u8fd9\u53f0 iPhone \u8fde\u4e0a Mac\uff0c\u8ba9 agent \u4e3a\u5b83\u7eed\u7b7e\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno types through its own keyboard and never touches the clipboard. When the keyboard can\u2019t be used, plain text is typed with key presses, and other text is not entered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u901a\u8fc7\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u952e\u76d8\u8f93\u5165\uff0c\u7edd\u4e0d\u4f7f\u7528\u526a\u8d34\u677f\u3002\u952e\u76d8\u65e0\u6cd5\u4f7f\u7528\u65f6\uff0c\u666e\u901a\u6587\u5b57\u7528\u6309\u952e\u8f93\u5165\uff0c\u5176\u4ed6\u6587\u5b57\u4e0d\u4f1a\u8f93\u5165\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno types through its own keyboard panel, at a person\u2019s pace. The panel has no keys: it shows while Qeno types, and Take Over stops it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u901a\u8fc7\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u952e\u76d8\u9762\u677f\u4ee5\u5e38\u4eba\u7684\u901f\u5ea6\u8f93\u5165\u3002\u9762\u677f\u6ca1\u6709\u6309\u952e\uff1aQeno \u8f93\u5165\u65f6\u663e\u793a\uff0c\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c\u63a5\u7ba1\u201d\u5373\u53ef\u505c\u6b62\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno types with key presses and pastes what the keys can\u2019t type, such as Chinese and emoji. Your clipboard is put back afterwards. The Qeno keyboard is not used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u7528\u6309\u952e\u8f93\u5165\uff0c\u6309\u952e\u65e0\u6cd5\u8f93\u5165\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\uff08\u5982\u4e2d\u6587\u548c\u8868\u60c5\u7b26\u53f7\uff09\u901a\u8fc7\u7c98\u8d34\u8f93\u5165\uff0c\u4e4b\u540e\u4f1a\u6062\u590d\u4f60\u7684\u526a\u8d34\u677f\u3002\u4e0d\u4f7f\u7528 Qeno \u952e\u76d8\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno uses your ChatGPT plan, the way Codex does. The sign-in stays in this iPhone\u2019s Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4e0e Codex \u4e00\u6837\uff0c\u5171\u4eab\u4f60\u7684 ChatGPT \u8ba2\u9605\u989d\u5ea6\u3002\u767b\u5f55\u4fe1\u606f\u4ec5\u4fdd\u5b58\u5728\u6b64 iPhone \u7684\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno will open Settings. Go to **Privacy & Security \u203a Developer Mode** and tap **Pair with Qeno**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5c06\u6253\u5f00\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u201d\u3002\u524d\u5f80\u201c**\u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168\u6027 \u203a \u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f**\u201d\u5e76\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c**\u4e0e Qeno \u914d\u5bf9**\u201d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno, details": {
      "localizations": {
