            "value": "\u5f00\u542f\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On Loopback": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f00\u542f\u56de\u73af"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on **Enable UI Automation**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f00\u542f\u201c**\u542f\u7528 UI \u81ea\u52a8\u5316**\u201d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Developer Mode, then tap **Restart**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f00\u542f\u201c\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f\u201d\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c**\u91cd\u65b0\u542f\u52a8**\u201d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Developer Mode: Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security \u2192 Developer Mode, then restart the phone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f00\u542f\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f\uff1a\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168 \u203a \u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u91cd\u542f\u624b\u673a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Developer Mode: Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security \u2192 Developer Mode, then restart the phone. If it is on: in Settings \u2192 General \u2192 VPN & Device Management, trust the developer of Qeno Runner.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f00\u542f\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f\uff1a\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168\u6027 \u203a \u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u91cd\u542f\u624b\u673a\u3002\u5982\u679c\u5df2\u5f00\u542f\uff1a\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u901a\u7528 \u203a VPN \u4e0e\u8bbe\u5907\u7ba1\u7406\u201d\u4e2d\u4fe1\u4efb Qeno Runner \u7684\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Enhanced Mode (required for loopback).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f00\u542f\u589e\u5f3a\u6a21\u5f0f\uff08\u56de\u73af\u4ec5\u5728\u589e\u5f3a\u6a21\u5f0f\u4e0b\u53ef\u7528\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on so your agents can use this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f00\u542f\u540e\uff0c\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u5373\u53ef\u4f7f\u7528\u6b64 iPhone\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the Qeno Device Loopback module.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f00\u542f Qeno Device Loopback \u6a21\u5757\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the loopback in your proxy app: the Qeno module in Surge or Loon, loopback_address in sing-box, or Shadowrocket's Settings \u2192 Other \u2192 \"Include route 10.7.0.1/32\". Then connect to Wi-Fi.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u4ee3\u7406 App \u4e2d\u5f00\u542f\u56de\u73af\uff1aSurge \u6216 Loon \u7684 Qeno \u6a21\u5757\uff0csing-box \u7684 loopback_address\uff0c\u6216 Shadowrocket \u7684\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u5176\u4ed6 \u203a \u5305\u542b\u8def\u7531 10.7.0.1/32\u201d\u3002\u7136\u540e\u8fde\u63a5\u65e0\u7ebf\u5c40\u57df\u7f51\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on your proxy app with the Qeno module, or connect LocalDevVPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u4ee3\u7406 App \u4e2d\u542f\u7528 Qeno \u6a21\u5757\uff0c\u6216\u8fde\u63a5 LocalDevVPN\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type it on the Pair with Qeno screen in Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u201d\u7684\u201c\u4e0e Qeno \u914d\u5bf9\u201d\u9875\u9762\u8f93\u5165"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type \u201cOn my way\u201d": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8f93\u5165\u201c\u5728\u8def\u4e0a\u4e86\u201d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Typing": {
