    },
    "Waiting for you to approve in the Dynamic Island": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7b49\u5f85\u5728\u7075\u52a8\u5c9b\u6279\u51c6"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your approval": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7b49\u5f85\u4f60\u6279\u51c6"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a free Apple ID, self-signed apps expire after 7 days and are limited to 3 at a time; Qeno and Qeno Runner use 2. For free Apple ID signing, install the external-connection build and use LocalDevVPN or a compatible VPN app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f7f\u7528\u514d\u8d39 Apple ID \u81ea\u7b7e\u540d\u7684 App \u4f1a\u5728 7 \u5929\u540e\u8fc7\u671f\uff0c\u4e14\u6700\u591a\u540c\u65f6\u5b89\u88c5 3 \u4e2a\uff08Qeno \u548c Qeno Runner \u5360 2 \u4e2a\uff09\u3002\u7528\u514d\u8d39 Apple ID \u7b7e\u540d\u65f6\uff0c\u8bf7\u5b89\u88c5\u5916\u90e8\u8fde\u63a5\u7248\uff0c\u5e76\u4f7f\u7528 LocalDevVPN \u6216\u517c\u5bb9\u7684 VPN App\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a free Apple ID, self-signed apps expire after 7 days and are limited to 3 at a time; Qeno and Qeno Runner use 2. Free accounts also can\u2019t sign a VPN, so Loopback requires your proxy app or LocalDevVPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f7f\u7528\u514d\u8d39 Apple ID \u81ea\u7b7e\u540d\u7684 App \u4f1a\u5728 7 \u5929\u540e\u8fc7\u671f\uff0c\u4e14\u6700\u591a\u540c\u65f6\u5b89\u88c5 3 \u4e2a\uff08Qeno \u548c Qeno Runner \u5360 2 \u4e2a\uff09\u3002\u514d\u8d39\u8d26\u6237\u4e5f\u65e0\u6cd5\u7b7e\u540d VPN\uff0c\u56e0\u6b64\u9700\u8981\u901a\u8fc7\u4ee3\u7406 App \u6216 LocalDevVPN \u63d0\u4f9b\u56de\u73af\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b63\u5728\u6267\u884c"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "YOUR API KEY": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684 API \u5bc6\u94a5"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agents can use this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u53ef\u4ee5\u4f7f\u7528\u8fd9\u53f0 iPhone\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your computer does the thinking. Qeno only taps and types.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7531\u7535\u8111\u7aef\u8d1f\u8d23\u63a8\u7406\uff0cQeno \u4ec5\u6267\u884c\u70b9\u51fb\u4e0e\u8f93\u5165\u64cd\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your proxy app or LocalDevVPN": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u4ee3\u7406 App \u6216 LocalDevVPN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your proxy app's tunnel is on, but 10.7.0.1 is not reflected. Turn on the Qeno module or route, then reconnect the proxy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ee3\u7406 App \u7684\u96a7\u9053\u5df2\u5f00\u542f\uff0c\u4f46 10.7.0.1 \u6ca1\u6709\u88ab\u53cd\u5c04\u3002\u8bf7\u5f00\u542f Qeno \u6a21\u5757\u6216\u8def\u7531\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u91cd\u65b0\u8fde\u63a5\u4ee3\u7406\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "failed: nothing changed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5931\u8d25\uff1a\u753b\u9762\u65e0\u53d8\u5316"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "http://your-mac.local:47830/voice/\u2026": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "http://your-mac.local:47830/voice/\u2026"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "https://\u2026/v1": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "https://\u2026/v1"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks for the passcode before UI Automation after Qeno Runner was force-closed or the iPhone restarted. Enter it once; Qeno carries on by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno Runner \u88ab\u5f3a\u5236\u9000\u51fa\u6216 iPhone \u91cd\u65b0\u542f\u52a8\u540e\uff0ciOS \u4f1a\u5148\u8981\u6c42\u8f93\u5165\u9501\u5c4f\u5bc6\u7801\uff0c\u518d\u5141\u8bb8 UI \u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u3002\u53ea\u9700\u8f93\u5165\u4e00\u6b21\uff0cQeno \u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u7ee7\u7eed\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks for the passcode to allow UI Automation after Qeno restarts, or 8 hours after it was last entered. Enter it once; Qeno carries on by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u91cd\u542f\u540e\uff0c\u6216\u8ddd\u4e0a\u6b21\u8f93\u5165\u5bc6\u7801\u8d85\u8fc7 8 \u5c0f\u65f6\uff0ciOS \u4f1a\u8981\u6c42\u8f93\u5165\u5bc6\u7801\u4ee5\u5141\u8bb8 UI \u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u3002\u8f93\u5165\u4e00\u6b21\u5373\u53ef\uff0cQeno \u4f1a\u81ea\u5df1\u7ee7\u7eed\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS requires a background mode to keep apps running. Qeno uses lowest-accuracy location and shows the location indicator while active.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS \u8981\u6c42 App \u58f0\u660e\u7279\u5b9a\u7528\u9014\u624d\u80fd\u5728\u540e\u53f0\u6301\u7eed\u8fd0\u884c\u3002Qeno \u4f1a\u4ee5\u6700\u4f4e\u7cbe\u5ea6\u4f7f\u7528\u5b9a\u4f4d\u670d\u52a1\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u8fd0\u884c\u671f\u95f4\u663e\u793a\u5b9a\u4f4d\u6307\u793a\u5668\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows the automation banner only while Qeno\u2019s automation session is open. Qeno opens it when an agent asks and closes it when idle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ec5\u5f53 Qeno \u7684\u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u4f1a\u8bdd\u6253\u5f00\u65f6\uff0ciOS \u624d\u4f1a\u663e\u793a\u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u6a2a\u5e45\u3002Qeno \u4f1a\u5728\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u8bf7\u6c42\u65f6\u6253\u5f00\u5b83\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u95f2\u7f6e\u65f6\u5173\u95ed\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows the automation banner only while the runner is active. Qeno starts it when needed and stops it when idle. Don\u2019t close Qeno Runner while an agent is working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ec5\u5f53 Runner \u8fd0\u884c\u65f6\uff0ciOS \u624d\u4f1a\u663e\u793a\u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u6a2a\u5e45\u3002Qeno \u4f1a\u5728\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u8bf7\u6c42\u65f6\u542f\u52a8\u5b83\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u95f2\u7f6e\u65f6\u505c\u6b62\u3002\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u5de5\u4f5c\u671f\u95f4\u8bf7\u52ff\u5173\u95ed Qeno Runner\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows this as a VPN. Enabling it may disconnect another VPN app. To keep a compatible VPN, choose External App instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS \u4f1a\u628a\u5b83\u663e\u793a\u4e3a VPN\u3002\u5f00\u542f\u540e\u53ef\u80fd\u65ad\u5f00\u5176\u4ed6 VPN App\u3002\u5982\u9700\u4fdd\u7559\u517c\u5bb9\u7684 VPN\uff0c\u8bf7\u6539\u9009\u201c\u5916\u90e8 App\u201d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows this as a VPN. Enabling it may disconnect another VPN app. To keep a compatible VPN, use your proxy app above instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS \u4f1a\u628a\u5b83\u663e\u793a\u4e3a VPN\u3002\u5f00\u542f\u540e\u53ef\u80fd\u65ad\u5f00\u5176\u4ed6 VPN App\u3002\u5982\u9700\u4fdd\u7559\u517c\u5bb9\u7684 VPN\uff0c\u8bf7\u6539\u7528\u4e0a\u65b9\u7684\u4ee3\u7406 App\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "pi has no model %@ for %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "pi \u4e2d\u672a\u627e\u5230 %2$@ \u7684\u6a21\u578b %1$@\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "sending a message": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u53d1\u9001\u4fe1\u606f"
